                      "properties":  {
                                         "Node name for S\u0026R":  "Note"
                                     },
                      "widgets_values":  [
                                             "IMAGE TO 3D WITH FOUR CARDINAL REFERENCES\n\nThis native Hunyuan multi-view model expects four views around one single character: FRONT, LEFT, BACK, RIGHT. Load four separate images of the same character, centered at a similar scale and with matching pose/lighting. Do not use a collage or repeat one composite image.\n\nThe included smoke-test crops are from one snail reference sheet: front_reference.png, left_reference.png, back_reference.png, and a mirrored left profile for right_reference.png. Replace these with your own four consistent views for production. A TOP view is not a supported input in this ComfyUI node.\n\nThe multi-view checkpoint is hunyuan3d-dit-v2-mv_fp16.safetensors. RTX 3060 12 GB: start at resolution 2048-3072, batch 1, octree 192-256. SaveGLB writes output/3D/Hunyuan_FourView_*.glb and the preview is a PNG."
                                         ],
